# Granola + work dispatch

When routing Kenneth's priorities or running `dispatch`:

1. Use **Granola MCP** before executing dispatch (`query_granola_meetings`, `list_meetings`, `get_meetings`).
2. Run `dispatch granola-queries` to get scoped queries per workstream.
3. Save results with `dispatch save-granola-context <workstream> <file>` (use `_manager` for Kenneth-wide context).
4. Include cached context in briefings via `dispatch run --granola`.

Reconcile pasted notes with what was actually decided in meetings. Cite meeting title and date when surfacing context.
